{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36829","headline":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 二 · 罗隐","name":"寄酬邺王罗令公五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"脉散源分历几朝，纵然官宦只卑僚。\n正忧末派沦沧海，忽见高枝拂绦霄。\n十万貔貅趋玉帐，三千宾客珥金貂。\n良时难得吾宗少，应念寒门更寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}